Package: picx--rdpcat
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: RDP-Cat Package Maintainer <maintainer@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/a2hop/rdp-cat
Depends: freerdp2x, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libssh2-1, sshpass
Description: RDP connection utility with SSH tunneling support
 rdp-cat is a utility for establishing RDP connections.
 .
 Registers the .rdpc connection file type so saved connections open
 with a double-click.
